        <item>
            <title>1.3.2</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 10:38:49 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Lina 1.3.2</h2>
<ul>
<li>Accounts on a FRITZ!Box (fritz.box), behind a company VPN or on a local name (.local) now register: Lina resolves server names exactly like the rest of macOS.</li>
<li>A server address that does not exist is now reported as « Server not found », in your language.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
